OL,3,GNEWSAArtist's drawings found under
OL,4,Aanti-slavery painting
OL,5,
OL,6,FA special camera has revealed how a
OL,7,F19th century painting with an
OL,8,Fanti-slavery message changed during its
OL,9,Fcreation.
OL,11,FThe Hunted Slaves, created in 1861 by
OL,12,FLiverpool artist Richard Andsell, is
OL,13,Famong art exhibits undergoing
OL,14,Fconservation work as the city's
OL,15,FInternational Slavery Museum is shut
OL,16,Ffor a major revamp.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
