OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAArtist's drawings found under
OL,4,Aanti-slavery painting
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe painting is more than 10ft (3m)
OL,7,Fwide and almost 6.5ft (2m) high and
OL,8,Fshows a man and woman fighting a pack
OL,9,Fof dogs, with broken chains hanging
OL,10,Ffrom the man's hand, implying they had
OL,11,Fescaped slavery.
OL,13,FConservators, who are cleaning the
OL,14,Fsurface of the artwork, said an
OL,15,Finfrared camera had shown the artist's
OL,16,Fdrawing changes which was "incredibly
OL,17,Fhelpful" for understanding the work.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
